---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Network Engineer specializing in IT infrastructure and support"
	pubDate={new Date('May 26 2025')}
	heroImage="/about.webp"
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Chris Tran, a Junior Network Engineer at Auto-Chlor System with 5 years of IT expertise and 2 years of team 
		leadership experience. I specialize in network administration, design, and deployment, with a strong focus on 
		providing enterprise-level technical support and managing complex network operations.
	</p>

	<p>
		In my current role, I handle end-user support, OS patching, remote network troubleshooting, and hybrid AD management. 
		I'm proficient with Microsoft Windows AD, PowerShell, Bash, TCP/IP, VPN, and FORTINET network equipment. My experience 
		includes 24/7 on-call support and collaboration with senior engineers on system architecture and software testing.
	</p>

	<p>
		My educational background includes pursuing an M.S. in Information Technology Management at Western Governors University, 
		building upon my B.S. in Mathematics-Computer Science from UC San Diego. I hold several certifications including CompTIA A+, 
		ITIL 4 Foundation, and Google IT Support, demonstrating my commitment to continuous learning and professional development.
	</p>

	<p>
		Throughout my career at organizations like Microsoft, Santa Clara County, and Amazon, I've developed a reputation for 
		being detail-oriented, adaptable, and an effective team player. I thrive in fast-paced environments and am passionate 
		about implementing innovative solutions to enhance operational efficiency.
	</p>

	<div class="contact-section">
		<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
		<p>
			I'm always open to discussing new opportunities and networking with fellow IT professionals. 
			Feel free to reach out through my social links or email me at <a href="mailto:career@christran.io">career@christran.io</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.contact-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}
	.contact-section h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.5em;
	}
</style>
